  "implemented": [
    "Generation-qualified owned selected-reactor plan with class2 common links, modeled DICTIONARY extensions, appdata and XDATA; identity/image-owner replacement only.",
    "Reject unresolved EED, DataStorage, nonreciprocal/ambiguous selections, inconsistent or duplicate reserved groups and non2 reactor class versions.",
    "Selected reactor-owned extension dictionaries and child back-references join the bounded existing graph; rooted current-generation alias rules remain enforced.",
    "Planned selected reactors must be consumed by actual IMAGE writes; source/replacement joins retain record rollback and whole-attempt retry behavior.",
    "Independent internal ASCII/binary DXF token observer uses standard-library primitives, not production reader/parser/writer/classifier/codec.",
    "Exact IMAGEDEF/reactor modeled field sequences, identities, common groups, doubles, path bytes, coordinates, integers, translated handles and chunked binary XDATA.",
    "Opt-in guarded BLOCKS/ENTITIES staged inspectors observe actual IMAGE340/360 edges exactly once in the raster subclass; default consumers keep streaming ENTITIES.",
    "Final publication joins unchanged source selections/owners/models to unique actual record types, sections, owners, modeled extension ownership and reference target identities.",
    "Published output facts are separate from standard-object/import-completeness/support counters; legacy/escape text and unmodeled state cannot acquire full-record field facts.",
    "Bounded output reference/scratch owners, indexed shared-definition lookups and once-per-definition final comparisons.",
    "Preserve public ImageDefinitionPlanEntry aggregate initialization with strict three-field/four-field compile probes; no new pure callback or language-standard increase."
  ],
